    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Hash-based indexing.</para><para>This index has O(N) insert, erase, and lookup times, although nominally the times are constant because the index uses hashing. The vertex or edge keys must have a hash function appropriate for <computeroutput>boost::unordered_map</computeroutput> and an equality operator.</para><para>The semantics for each of the class methods are documented in <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1Container_1_1GraphVoidIndex" kindref="compound">GraphVoidIndex</ref>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
